v class="pc-ctl"><button class="pc-step" type="button" data-step="-1" aria-label="One fewer employee" aria-controls="pc-n" hidden><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></button><input class="pc-range" id="pc-n" type="range" min="1" max="31" value="8" step="1" aria-valuetext="8 employees, $19 a month" disabled><button class="pc-step" type="button" data-step="1" aria-label="One more employee" aria-controls="pc-n" hidden><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></button></div><p class="pc-note" data-note>Billed monthly, per business.</p><p class="sr" role="status" data-pc-live></p></div></section><section class="chap day30" id="price" aria-labelledby="price-t"><div class="wrap days-grid price-grid"><div><h2 class="t2 rise" id="price-t">After 30 days, one monthly price</h2><p class="price-mine" data-price-mine hidden></p><ul class="price-bands fade" aria-label="Prices"><li><b>$19 <span>a month</span></b><span>Up to 15 employees</span></li><li><b>$29 <span>a month</span></b><span>16 to 30 employees</span></li></ul><p class="price-inc fade">Every business gets the whole app: scheduling, the time clock, timecards and payroll calculation. The price depends only on how many employees you have, and owners aren’t counted.</p><p class="days-fine">Prices are in US dollars and may change before online billing opens. Cancel any time and NEVORA keeps working through the month you paid for. If you don’t subscribe after the trial, NEVORA pauses for your team; the Owner can still open billing and export available payroll records.</p><div class="hacts day-acts fade"><a class="hb fill" href="/?preview_theme_id=193268777274&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora-demo">Request a free trial<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a><a class="hb" href="/?preview_theme_id=193268777274&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora">More than 30 employees?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div><p class="price-help">Already on NEVORA? The business Owner opens billing from NEVORA, in Settings. <a href="/?preview_theme_id=193268777274&amp;view=velani-nevora-billing">Billing help</a></p></div></div></section><section class="chap days" aria-labelledby="days-t"><div class="wrap days-grid"><div><h2 class="t2 rise" id="days-t">Your 30 days</h2><ol class="days-list"><li class="fade"><p class="days-k" data-day="1">Day 1</p><p>Your workplace is ready. You invite your team, and each person gets a PIN for the time clock tablet.</p></li><li class="fade"><p class="days-k">First week</p><p>You publish the schedule. Your team sees their shifts on their phones, swaps shifts and asks for time off, in English or Spanish.</p></li><li class="fade"><p class="days-k">Second week</p><p>You approve timecards. NEVORA calculates payroll from the approved hours and makes a pay statement for each employee.</p></li><li class="fade"><p class="days-k" data-day="30">Day 30</p><p>On day 30, the Owner picks a plan in NEVORA. Nothing is charged until you do.</p></li></ol><p class="days-fine">NEVORA calculates pay statements. It does not pay employees or file payroll taxes.</p></div><div 