v class="pc-ctl"><button class="pc-step" type="button" data-step="-1" aria-label="One fewer employee" aria-controls="pc-n" hidden><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></button><input class="pc-range" id="pc-n" type="range" min="1" max="31" value="8" step="1" aria-valuetext="8 employees, $19 a month" disabled><button class="pc-step" type="button" data-step="1" aria-label="One more employee" aria-controls="pc-n" hidden><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></button></div><p class="pc-note" data-note>Billed monthly, per business.</p><p class="sr" role="status" data-pc-live></p></div></section><section class="chap day30" id="price" aria-labelledby="price-t"><div class="wrap days-grid price-grid"><div><h2 class="t2 rise" id="price-t">After 30 days, one monthly price</h2><p class="price-mine" data-price-mine hidden></p><ul class="price-bands fade" aria-label="Prices"><li><b>$19 <span>a month</span></b><span>Up to 15 employees</span></li><li><b>$29 <span>a month</span></b><span>16 to 30 employees</span></li></ul><p class="price-inc fade">Every business gets the whole app: scheduling, the time clock, timecards and payroll calculation. The price depends only on how many employees you have, and owners aren’t counted.</p><p class="days-fine">Prices are in US dollars and may change before online billing opens. Cancel any time and NEVORA keeps working through the month you paid for. If you don’t subscribe after the trial, NEVORA pauses for your team; the Owner can still open billing and export available payroll records.</p><div class="hacts day-acts fade"><a class="hb fill" href="/?prev